  - [Ranged numeric types][RangedI64ValueParser]: `u8`, `i8`, `u16`, `i16`, `u32`, `i32`, `u64`, `i64`
- [`ValueEnum` types][crate::ValueEnum]
- [`From<OsString>` types][std::convert::From] and [`From<&OsStr>` types][std::convert::From]
